n’t you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057760/extras/978085f0793267ac29e16d9fda7c2d43.avif?t=1773412580\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE QUESTING TREE.</strong> Your quest log, skill tree, and mind map all at once. Each Quest Branch can take root in your mind and alter The Cleric’s playstyle through game-changing feats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057760/extras/7354cd08d5365f9dec87817031fb11e5.avif?t=1773412580\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Esoteric Ebb is a single-player CRPG inspired by the freedom of tabletop adventures. Unravel a political conspiracy with your goblin sidekick. Roll dice in tense encounters. Become a cleric of legends or completely ruin the campaign.", "supported_languages": "англійська", "reviews": "“Esoteric Ebb is an achievement in video game storytelling, and one of the most endearing, hilarious and immersive roleplaying experiences I’ve ever had in the medium. It’s absolutely a must-play, and carves out an astonishing identity for itself beyond the D&amp;D and Disco Elysium inspirations that drive it.”<br>The Sixth Axis<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057760/3fc3e737678a0d5db6816609bec2c9c6f2c11a88/header.jpg?t=1773412580", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057760/0c8f3c4b30a022b6ce816096db0dfd385199226b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773412580", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057760/0c8f3c4b30a022b6ce816096db0dfd385199226b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773412580", "website": "https://esotericebb.com/", "pc_require